    "name": "Car Dealer Simulator: Prologue - Early Days",
    "steam_appid": 3115010,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/78104f11e3eab16437029a4318997ba8.avif?t=1748944884\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Car Dealer Simulator Early Days is a free prologue to the full Car Dealer Simulator game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Sam, the quirky owner of the business, will introduce you to its secrets. He\u2019s not great at keeping things in order, so your task is to buy low, fix up, and sell high. In the full game, if you handle the initial tasks well, you\u2019ll have the chance to take over the business, and then\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/5e362b2c90348549cc4a3f8108d0b765.avif?t=1748944884\" width=630 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything will be in your hands! Build a business that fulfills your customers\u2019 automotive fantasies. From budget-friendly cars to extravagant rides, seize opportunities, hire the best, provide excellent service, and maximize profits. Grow your company day by day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/da25100076ad3105d481a7bb8f65ba23.poster.avif?t=1748944884\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/da25100076ad3105d481a7bb8f65ba23.webm?t=1748944884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/da25100076ad3105d481a7bb8f65ba23.mp4?t=1748944884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to achieving high profits lies in negotiating when buying old cars. Look for great deals, and during price haggling, stay firm and professional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/2817e06ed1db8305e33e68eee3cb500f.poster.avif?t=1748944884\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/2817e06ed1db8305e33e68eee3cb500f.webm?t=1748944884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/2817e06ed1db8305e33e68eee3cb500f.mp4?t=1748944884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all purchased cars are in working condition, so you\u2019ll need to use a tow truck to transport them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/44cbccf454a6c76bae81cc381f28e43e.poster.avif?t=1748944884\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/44cbccf454a6c76bae81cc381f28e43e.webm?t=1748944884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/44cbccf454a6c76bae81cc381f28e43e.mp4?t=1748944884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every car requires diagnostics and preparation before being sold. At Little Sam\u2019s request, you\u2019ll perform your first mechanical and bodywork repairs. In the prologue, the available tools are quite limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/9e60e5fb6bb374838e34ada0201ccd92.poster.avif?t=1748944884\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/9e60e5fb6bb374838e34ada0201ccd92.webm?t=1748944884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/9e60e5fb6bb374838e34ada0201ccd92.mp4?t=1748944884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Presenting a car to the customer requires a few tricks. Washing, good photos, and an engaging advertisement will be your allies. Little Sam will guide you through tasks such as washing, taking photos, and creating a sales listing. Remember, customers buy with their eyes, so use the shine of the paint, a full tank, and quality photos to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/8a8e9426786c8e8f4d11762a65233c2e.poster.avif?t=1748944884\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/8a8e9426786c8e8f4d11762a65233c2e.webm?t=1748944884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/8a8e9426786c8e8f4d11762a65233c2e.mp4?t=1748944884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your profits will allow you to continually grow your company. In the prologue, you\u2019ll have the chance to upgrade the car wash, while in the full game, you\u2019ll unlock additional tools, repair zones, and the customer service office.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Car Dealer Simulator Early Days is a free prologue to the full Car Dealer Simulator game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Sam, the quirky owner of the business, will introduce you to its secrets. He\u2019s not great at keeping things in order, so your task is to buy low, fix up, and sell high. In the full game, if you handle the initial tasks well, you\u2019ll have the chance to take over the business, and then\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/5e362b2c90348549cc4a3f8108d0b765.avif?t=1748944884\" width=630 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything will be in your hands! Build a business that fulfills your customers\u2019 automotive fantasies. From budget-friendly cars to extravagant rides, seize opportunities, hire the best, provide excellent service, and maximize profits. Grow your company day by day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/da25100076ad3105d481a7bb8f65ba23.poster.avif?t=1748944884\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/da25100076ad3105d481a7bb8f65ba23.webm?t=1748944884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/da25100076ad3105d481a7bb8f65ba23.mp4?t=1748944884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to achieving high profits lies in negotiating when buying old cars. Look for great deals, and during price haggling, stay firm and professional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/2817e06ed1db8305e33e68eee3cb500f.poster.avif?t=1748944884\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/2817e06ed1db8305e33e68eee3cb500f.webm?t=1748944884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/2817e06ed1db8305e33e68eee3cb500f.mp4?t=1748944884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all purchased cars are in working condition, so you\u2019ll need to use a tow truck to transport them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/44cbccf454a6c76bae81cc381f28e43e.poster.avif?t=1748944884\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/44cbccf454a6c76bae81cc381f28e43e.webm?t=1748944884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/44cbccf454a6c76bae81cc381f28e43e.mp4?t=1748944884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every car requires diagnostics and preparation before being sold. At Little Sam\u2019s request, you\u2019ll perform your first mechanical and bodywork repairs. In the prologue, the available tools are quite limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/9e60e5fb6bb374838e34ada0201ccd92.poster.avif?t=1748944884\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/9e60e5fb6bb374838e34ada0201ccd92.webm?t=1748944884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/9e60e5fb6bb374838e34ada0201ccd92.mp4?t=1748944884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Presenting a car to the customer requires a few tricks. Washing, good photos, and an engaging advertisement will be your allies. Little Sam will guide you through tasks such as washing, taking photos, and creating a sales listing. Remember, customers buy with their eyes, so use the shine of the paint, a full tank, and quality photos to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/8a8e9426786c8e8f4d11762a65233c2e.poster.avif?t=1748944884\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/8a8e9426786c8e8f4d11762a65233c2e.webm?t=1748944884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115010/extras/8a8e9426786c8e8f4d11762a65233c2e.mp4?t=1748944884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your profits will allow you to continually grow your company. In the prologue, you\u2019ll have the chance to upgrade the car wash, while in the full game, you\u2019ll unlock additional tools, repair zones, and the customer service office.</p>",
